{
    "title": "TREBEL: Music, MP3 & Podcasts",
    "description": "TREBEL Music is the only free music app that let's you listen to your favorite music offline, on-demand, and anytime!\r\n\r\nMake music better with TREBEL!\r\n\r\nTREBEL Music is the ultimate music app for you! It's a free, offline music player that lets you discover and download unlimited music anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\nWith TREBEL Music, you can easily find your favorite tracks, artists, and albums, or discover new ones with our curated playlists. Choose from new releases or all-time favorites, spanning genres like Hip Hop, Pop, EDM, Rap, Country, Latin, R&B, Reggaeton, and more.\r\n\r\n Wherever you go, music follows: Download music for offline listening and save your data for other adventures. \r\n\r\nBreak out of your musical routine and find your new musical obsession with our immersive, smart \u201cDiscover\u201d section. \r\n\r\nShake up your soundtrack and expand your musical horizons with our instant playlist creator, powered by AI. \r\n\r\nUnleash your inner DJ! Enjoy on-demand playback with unlimited skips and  without limitations such as shuffle-only modes. Create and share your playlists to match your unique vibe. \r\n\r\nAll of your songs, one place: Easily import your existing mp3 music library into TREBEL! \r\n\r\nTREBEL Music is completely free - no subscription or credit card required.\r\n\r\nTREBEL is a licensed service with the best music in the world.\r\n\r\nHIT US UP BELOW!\r\nwww.trebel.io",
